flowchart TD
  Args[CLI arguments] --> Adventure{generate-adventure-environment?}
  Adventure -->|yes| Generate[Read source folder and write SQL]
  Adventure -->|no| Optimize{optimize-history?}
  Optimize -->|yes| OptimizeDB[Run requested history operation]
  Optimize -->|no| History{inspect-history?}
  History -->|yes| Inspect[Inspect migration folder and print report]
  History -->|no| Mode{verify or adopt}
  Mode --> Verify[Check migration history only]
  Mode --> Adopt[Verify adoption then apply pending Diesel migrations]
